Splash is a derivative work of Komelia: the original Kotlin Multiplatform
source was translated to Swift and modified. Modifications include, but are
not limited to, a SwiftUI user interface, GRDB-backed persistence, an
ImageIO/Core Graphics image pipeline, a Readium-based EPUB reader, PDFKit
rendering, background downloads via URLSession, and StoreKit 2 purchases.

The Komga REST wire models and HTTP clients are additionally derived from
komga-client (https://github.com/Snd-R/komga-client), Copyright the
komga-client authors (Snd-R), licensed under the MIT License.

Komga (https://github.com/gotson/komga) is the media server this client
talks to. Splash is an unofficial, independent client and is not affiliated
with or endorsed by the Komga project.

